runs/
datasets/
*.cache
# 데이터셋 압축본·라벨 확인용 컨택트시트
*.zip
jetson-orin-nano/Dataset/
_viz_*.jpg
# Colab/Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
wandb/

